WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.292
Your calendar can help you remember people you have met. Let's export a calendar you manage.

2
00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:12.542
On a computer, open Google Calendar. Choose the settings gear, then Settings.

3
00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:16.333
In the settings menu, choose Import and export.

4
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:22.708
Choose Export. Google downloads a ZIP containing individual ICS calendar files.

5
00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:29.667
Unzip the download and choose an ICS file. Work administrators may restrict calendar exports.

6
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:37.042
Import the ICS file in Gold Mine Genie. Review the people and context before planning personal outreach.
